cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use vcdd in your research, please cite the software as below."
title: "vcdd: a virtual-cell-guided drug design workflow"
abstract: >-
  vcdd is a configuration-driven workflow framework that links GPU-accelerated
  docking, Boltz-2 complex-confidence and affinity prediction, virtual-cell
  transcriptomic scoring, and constrained parent-to-analog generation with joint
  structural and cellular rescoring on a single executable and restartable path.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-09-23"
keywords:
  - virtual screening
  - molecular docking
  - virtual cell
  - transcriptomic perturbation
  - drug design
  - DNA-PKcs
authors:
  - name: "vcdd contributors"
